sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Client
    participant App as Mobile App
    participant API as Backend API
    participant DB as Database
    participant Storage as Supabase Storage
    participant FCM as Firebase FCM

    C->>App: Buka halaman Buat Booking
    App->>API: GET /api/v1/equipment?company_id
    API->>DB: SELECT equipment WHERE company_id = ?
    DB-->>API: List equipment
    API-->>App: 200 OK
    App-->>C: Tampilkan form booking

    C->>App: Isi form service_type, urgency, deskripsi, lokasi

    opt Ada foto yang diupload
        App->>Storage: Upload foto
        Storage-->>App: URL foto
    end

    App->>API: POST /api/v1/bookings
    API->>DB: INSERT INTO bookings status open
    DB-->>API: booking_id

    API->>FCM: Push notifikasi ke Manager
    FCM-->>API: OK

    API-->>App: 201 Created
    App-->>C: Konfirmasi booking berhasil dibuat
